    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A tremendous blow to your back cracks a couple of vertebrae, temporarily paralyzing your legs as your spinal column momentarily flexes and compresses the spinal canal.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Prone], except you can’t rise or use your legs for anything until you’ve passed a <strong>Hard (-20) Endurance</strong> Test, getting to roll at the end of each of your subsequent turns.</p>"
